# The repository root ignores Unity-generated *.sln / *.csproj. These are hand-written P1 lab project files and MUST be tracked.
!*.sln
!*.csproj

# P1-owned local data root (future saves; never committed). Never P0's .lab-data/.
.p1-data/
# Isolated P0 Core binary reference, rebuilt from the pinned P0 tree by build/build-p0-core-ref.sh (never committed).
.p0ref/
# Build output (P1 only)
bin/
obj/
TestResults/
# Local evidence scratch (durable evidence lives off-repo under /media/jer/Files/CCF/Verification)
evidence/*
!evidence/README.md
